{
  "info": {
    "name": "MS Data Gateway - Query Engine & QAD Business Services API",
    "description": "Colección oficial para ms-data-gateway. Refleja fielmente el alcance real del sistema:\n1. Query Engine: SELECT, Metadata, Catálogo de Datasources, Consultas Registradas, Multi-datasource Routing y Auditoría.\n2. QAD Business Services (SOAP QXtend): Escritura de negocio en QAD mediante servicios SOAP/QXtend oficiales (BCreditor, etc.) y gestión del catálogo gateway_service.\nNOTA IMPORTANTE: No se soportan escrituras genéricas JDBC (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE). Toda escritura de negocio en QAD se realiza exclusivamente mediante QXtend SOAP.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base del microservicio ms-data-gateway"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "dev-api-key-001",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API Key de consumo estándar (X-API-Key)"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminKey",
      "value": "dev-admin-key-999",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API Key administrativa para catálogo y CRUD (X-Admin-Key)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - QAD Business Services (SOAP QXtend)",
      "description": "Servicios de negocio para operaciones de escritura en QAD ERP mediante QXtend SOAP y gestión de su catálogo técnico en MySQL (gateway_service).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST - Crear o Actualizar Creditor/Proveedor (BCreditor)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"creditorCode\": \"60000011\",\n  \"businessRelationCode\": \"60000011\",\n  \"businessRelationName1\": \"HUGO CESAR MUNTANE RODRIGUEZ\",\n  \"vatDeliveryType\": \"PRODUCT\",\n  \"vatPercentageLevel\": \"NONE\",\n  \"taxZone\": \"MX\",\n  \"taxClass\": \"HON\",\n  \"paymentConditionCode\": \"30\",\n  \"paymentConditionType\": \"NORMAL\",\n  \"currencyCode\": \"MXN\",\n  \"purchaseTypeCode\": \"B001\",\n  \"invControlGLProfileCode\": \"P_2010\",\n  \"cnControlGLProfileCode\": \"P_2010\",\n  \"prepayControlGLProfileCode\": \"P_2010\",\n  \"divisionProfileCode\": \"Sub_0620\",\n  \"reasonCode\": \"INV TO APPROVE\",\n  \"purchaseGLProfileCode\": \"P_Compras\",\n  \"companyCode\": \"0111\",\n  \"domain\": \"MXMGT01\",\n  \"entity\": \"0109\",\n  \"action\": \"SAVE\",\n  \"activityCode\": \"CREATE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/qad/creditors",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "qad",
                "creditors"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Recibe un JSON simple, construye el Envelope SOAP 1.1 con WS-Addressing y dsSessionContext, ejecuta la llamada HTTP a QXtend y retorna una respuesta JSON estructurada."
          },
